{"page":195,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:48","surah":9,"ayah":48,"ar_uthmani":"لَقَدِ ٱبْتَغَوُا۟ ٱلْفِتْنَةَ مِن قَبْلُ وَقَلَّبُوا۟ لَكَ ٱلْأُمُورَ حَتَّىٰ جَآءَ ٱلْحَقُّ وَظَهَرَ أَمْرُ ٱللَّهِ وَهُمْ كَـٰرِهُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Indeed, they had tried before that to stir up discord: they devised plots against you [Prophet] until the truth was exposed and God’s will triumphed, much to their disgust.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَقَدِ","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"laqadi","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱبْتَغَوُا۟","en_gloss":"they had sought","transliteration":"ib'taghawū","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْفِتْنَةَ","en_gloss":"dissension","transliteration":"l-fit'nata","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَقَلَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"and had upset","transliteration":"waqallabū","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَكَ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"laka","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأُمُورَ","en_gloss":"the matters","transliteration":"l-umūra","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"came","transliteration":"jāa","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْحَقُّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَظَهَرَ","en_gloss":"and became manifest","transliteration":"waẓahara","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَمْرُ","en_gloss":"(the) Order of Allah","transliteration":"amru","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(the) Order of Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":16,"ar":"كَـٰرِهُونَ","en_gloss":"disliked (it)","transliteration":"kārihūna","verse_key":"9:48"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٤٨","en_gloss":"(48)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:48"}]},{"verse_key":"9:49","surah":9,"ayah":49,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنْهُم مَّن يَقُولُ ٱئْذَن لِّى وَلَا تَفْتِنِّىٓ ۚ أَلَا فِى ٱلْفِتْنَةِ سَقَطُوا۟ ۗ وَإِنَّ جَهَنَّمَ لَمُحِيطَةٌۢ بِٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Some of them said, ‘Give me permission to stay at home: do not trouble me.’ They are already in trouble: Hell will engulf the disbelievers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنْهُم","en_gloss":"And among them","transliteration":"wamin'hum","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(is he) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَقُولُ","en_gloss":"says","transliteration":"yaqūlu","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱئْذَن","en_gloss":"Grant me leave","transliteration":"i'dhan","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِّى","en_gloss":"Grant me leave","transliteration":"lī","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَفْتِنِّىٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"put me to trial","transliteration":"taftinnī","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَلَا","en_gloss":"Surely","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْفِتْنَةِ","en_gloss":"the trial","transliteration":"l-fit'nati","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَقَطُوا۟ ۗ","en_gloss":"they have fallen","transliteration":"saqaṭū","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":13,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَمُحِيطَةٌۢ","en_gloss":"(will) surely surround","transliteration":"lamuḥīṭatun","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers","transliteration":"bil-kāfirīna","verse_key":"9:49"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٤٩","en_gloss":"(49)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:49"}]},{"verse_key":"9:50","surah":9,"ayah":50,"ar_uthmani":"إِن تُصِبْكَ حَسَنَةٌ تَسُؤْهُمْ ۖ وَإِن تُصِبْكَ مُصِيبَةٌ يَقُولُوا۟ قَدْ أَخَذْنَآ أَمْرَنَا مِن قَبْلُ وَيَتَوَلَّوا۟ وَّهُمْ فَرِحُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you [Prophet] have good fortune, it will grieve them, but if misfortune comes your way, they will say to themselves, ‘We took precautions for this,’ and go away rejoicing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُصِبْكَ","en_gloss":"befalls you","transliteration":"tuṣib'ka","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حَسَنَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"ḥasanatun","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَسُؤْهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"it distresses them","transliteration":"tasu'hum","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"but if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تُصِبْكَ","en_gloss":"befalls you","transliteration":"tuṣib'ka","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُصِيبَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a calamity","transliteration":"muṣībatun","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَقُولُوا۟","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"yaqūlū","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَخَذْنَآ","en_gloss":"we took","transliteration":"akhadhnā","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَمْرَنَا","en_gloss":"our matter","transliteration":"amranā","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قَبْلُ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"qablu","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَيَتَوَلَّوا۟","en_gloss":"And they turn away","transliteration":"wayatawallaw","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَرِحُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) rejoicing","transliteration":"fariḥūna","verse_key":"9:50"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٥٠","en_gloss":"(50)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:50"}]},{"verse_key":"9:51","surah":9,"ayah":51,"ar_uthmani":"قُل لَّن يُصِيبَنَآ إِلَّا مَا كَتَبَ ٱللَّهُ لَنَا هُوَ مَوْلَىٰنَا ۚ وَعَلَى ٱللَّهِ فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘Only what God has decreed will happen to us. He is our Master: let the believers put their trust in God.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُل","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَّن","en_gloss":"Never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُصِيبَنَآ","en_gloss":"will befall us","transliteration":"yuṣībanā","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَتَبَ","en_gloss":"Allah has decreed","transliteration":"kataba","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has decreed","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَنَا","en_gloss":"for us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَوْلَىٰنَا ۚ","en_gloss":"(is) our Protector","transliteration":"mawlānā","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَعَلَى","en_gloss":"And on","transliteration":"waʿalā","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ","en_gloss":"[so] let the believers put (their) trust","transliteration":"falyatawakkali","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"[so] let the believers put (their) trust","transliteration":"l-mu'minūna","verse_key":"9:51"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٥١","en_gloss":"(51)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:51"}]},{"verse_key":"9:52","surah":9,"ayah":52,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ هَلْ تَرَبَّصُونَ بِنَآ إِلَّآ إِحْدَى ٱلْحُسْنَيَيْنِ ۖ وَنَحْنُ نَتَرَبَّصُ بِكُمْ أَن يُصِيبَكُمُ ٱللَّهُ بِعَذَابٍ مِّنْ عِند